glossed \"disgrace me\" at 26:87 — carries the root خزي. The others come from different roots."},{"type":"multiple_choice","question":"What does ٱلْخِزْىَ mean?","options":["with his family","(of) your sisters","taken","the disgrace"],"correct":3,"explanation":"\"the disgrace\", from the word-by-word gloss at 16:27."},{"type":"fill_blank","question":"Type the root of خِزْىِ in Arabic (three letters).","correct":"خزي","explanation":"خزي. Diacritics are ignored when checking, so خ ز ي is enough."}]', '["root-wDE"]', 31, NULL);
