 The others come from different roots."},{"type":"multiple_choice","question":"What does حِدَادٍ mean?","options":["sharp","(is) appreciated","while Allah","And believed"],"correct":0,"explanation":"\"sharp\", from the word-by-word gloss at 33:19."},{"type":"fill_blank","question":"Type the root of حَدِيدٍۢ in Arabic (three letters).","correct":"حدد","explanation":"حدد. Diacritics are ignored when checking, so ح د د is enough."}]', '["root-HDr"]', 31, NULL);
