e root حول. The others come from different roots."},{"type":"multiple_choice","question":"What does يَحُولُ mean?","options":["(of) Allah","comes","belong to Allah","He seizes"],"correct":1,"explanation":"\"comes\", from the word-by-word gloss at 8:24."},{"type":"fill_blank","question":"Type the root of حَوْلَهُم in Arabic (three letters).","correct":"حول","explanation":"حول. Diacritics are ignored when checking, so ح و ل is enough."}]', '["root-Hdd"]', 31, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lessons (id, title, module, level, content, exercises, prerequisites, estimated_minutes, category) VALUES ('root-Sly', 'The root صلي (ص ل ي)', 'grammar', 4, '{"explanation":"The root صلي occurs 25 times in the Quran. Arabic builds words from three-letter roots, so learning one root unlocks every word derived from it — this one appears in 20 distinct glossed words, tagged in the corpus as V, N, in verb forms IV, VIII, II. The words below are attested occurrences with their word-by-word glosses.","examples":[{"arabic":"صَلُّوهُ","transliteration":"","meaning":"burn him","rule":"69:31"},{"arabic":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا","transliteration":"","meaning":"(in) it they will burn","rule":"14:29"},{"arabic":"نُصْلِيهِ","transliteration":"","meaning":"We (will) cast him","rule":"4:30"},{"arabic":"وَتَصْلِيَةُ","transliteration":"","meaning":"And burning","rule":"56:94"},{"arabic":"وَيَصْلَىٰ","transliteration":"","meaning":"And he will burn","rule":"84:12"},{"arabic":"لَصَالُوا۟","transliteration":"","meaning":"(surely) will burn","rule":"83:16"}],"rules":[{"name":"Words on صلي","description":"Attested in the Quranic Arabic Corpus. Each is a real occurrence rather than a constructed example, and the reference is where to find it.","examples":["صَلُّوهُ","يَصْلَوْنَهَا","نُصْلِيهِ","وَتَصْلِيَةُ","وَيَصْلَىٰ","لَصَالُوا۟","وَسَيَصْلَوْنَ","ٱصْلَوْهَا"]},{"name":"Parts of speech attested for صلي","description":"The morphology corpus tags words on this root as V, N — 2 distinct parts of speech across the 20 glossed words attested.","examples":["صَلُّوهُ","يَصْلَوْنَهَا","نُصْلِيهِ","وَتَصْلِيَةُ","وَيَصْلَىٰ","لَصَالُوا۟"]},{"name":"Verb forms attested for صلي","description":"Where this root is tagged as a verb, the corpus attests derived Forms IV, VIII, II.","examples":["صَلُّوهُ","يَصْلَوْنَهَا","نُصْلِيهِ","وَتَصْلِيَةُ","وَيَصْلَىٰ","لَصَالُوا۟"]}]}', '[{"type":"multiple_choice","question":"Which of these words is built on the root صلي?","options":["فَأْتُوا۟",